  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "BBQ wings are baked on a rack so hot air circulates around them, making the skin crisp without deep-frying. The BBQ sauce goes on in layers over the last fifteen minutes to caramelise to a sticky, dark finish. They're easier to manage than fried wings when making a large batch."
          }
        ]
      },
